    "description": "<p>Spires of jagged rock erupt from the ground beneath your foes, closing around them. Each target hit by this spell suffers<strong>【HR + 15】earth</strong> damage. This spell cannot target creatures who are flying, floating, falling, or otherwise in mid-air. </p><p><strong>Opportunity:</strong> Each target hit by this spell performs one fewer action on their next turn (to a minimum of 0 actions). </p><hr /><p><strong>@LOSS[10 mp]</strong> for <strong>one</strong> target.</p><p><strong>@LOSS[20 mp]</strong> for <strong>two</strong> targets.</p><p><strong>@LOSS[30 mp]</strong> for <strong>three</strong> targets.</p>",
